        "    case limit:",
        "        print(\"Full\")",
        "    case 0:",
        "        print(\"Game over\")"
      ],
      "explain": "A plain name in a case does not compare with that variable. It matches anything and stores the value in that name, so the cases after it could never run. Python refuses with a SyntaxError. Write the value itself.",
